discarded disposition directly assertable per the test plan's storage-contract note; background mode separately proven; (3) --message/--message-id flag aliases parse to one input — additive ergonomics; (4) tool_call edit content-lands-verbatim is consistent with the design's content: string signature; flagged for the Story 6 record. No contract drift.\"\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:36:**Scope In:** Delete `src/cli/`, package `bin`, spawned-process suites, the named-provider registry, CLI-only exports, and env/flag provider resolution.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:45:- **AC-6.1**: `src/cli/` is deleted; the package publishes no binary; SDK exports drop the CLI-only entries (`resolveNamedProvider`, `registeredProviderNames`, and the registry module). The public API surface is SDK-only.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:47:- **AC-6.3**: The env/flag provider-resolution path is gone: no code path reads `LHC_PROVIDER`, and provider arrival is injection at `createSdk` only.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:52:  - public-API surface snapshot: export-name set of the package entry equals the checked-in SDK-only list; no `resolveNamedProvider`, no `registeredProviderNames`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:57:  - source scan: zero `LHC_PROVIDER` / `--provider` references under `src/`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/01-cli-retirement/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:65:This is a deletion-first packaging story. It removes the process CLI, its package binary, the named-provider registry, env/