C-5.4 |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/test-plan.md:33:| TC-3.4 | cli-process-inspect :: list/show parity | spawned `lhc messages list/show` JSON deep-equals in-process SDK results |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/test-plan.md:40:| TC-5.4 | cli-process-inspect :: checkpoint parity | spawned CLI overview/view/list at three checkpoints deep-equal in-process results at same checkpoints |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/test-plan.md:68:Per-story: `pnpm verify` (lint, typecheck, default suites). Story 4 and epic close: `LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1 pnpm verify-all` — process suite must report `ran`. Red manifests regenerated per chunk per house discipline; no Epic 01–03 test amendments expected (additive surfaces only — list-opts default behavior is unchanged, existing `listMessages` callers see identical results).\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/004-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"8c3b7669-00c6-4be2-8972-c22ac4454f53\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb551-8be9-7382-8a9c-1175cc0fca3e\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb551-8be9-7382-8a9c-1175cc0fca3e\",\"storyId\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-message-edit-cascade\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Message Edit and Cascade\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/stories/05-message-edit-cascade.md\",\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/tech-design.md\",\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/test-plan.md\",\"packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/003-implementor.json\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/cascade.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/cli/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/cli/messages-mutate.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/shared/storage.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/forms.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/forms.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts\",\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\",\"packages/lhc/package.json\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Initial verification read the story, tech design, test plan, implementor package, changed production paths, and TC-5.x tests. Story and epic gates passed, but the production edit path has one blocking validation gap: it accepts messages that are not in a closed turn.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"F-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"messages.edit accepts turnless messages instead of enforcing the closed-turn target boundary\",\"evidence\":\"Story scope requires messages.edit to validate a closed-turn target (story lines 15-20), and AC-5.1 is scoped to editing a message in a closed turn. In code, readMutableMessage explicitly allows turnStatus null for a gap/no-membership message (packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts:48-79), and messages.edit only refuses target.turnStatus === 'open' before applying the edit (packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts:411-434). I verified the production path with an ad hoc runtime scenario: a thread containing only a runtime_note before any prompt produced m1 with no turnId; messages.edit({ messageId: 'm1', content: 'edited gap' }) returned ok:true with changed.messageIds ['m1'] and an empty cascade, and listMessages showed the content mutated. That changes sanctioned record state outside the required closed-turn class.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"Story Scope: validate target closed turn\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"F-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"messages.edit accepts turnless messages instead of enforcing the closed-turn target boundary\",\"evidence\":\"Story scope requires messages.edit to validate a closed-turn target (story lines 15-20), and AC-5.1 is scoped to editing a message in a closed turn. In code, readMutableMessage explicitly allows turnStatus null for a gap/no-membership message (packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts:48-79), and messages.edit only refuses target.turnStatus === 'open' before applying the edit (packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts:411-434). I verified the production path with an ad hoc runtime scenario: a thread containing only a runtime_note before any prompt produced m1 with no turnId; messages.edit({ messageId: 'm1', content: 'edited gap' }) returned ok:true with changed.messageIds ['m1'] and an empty cascade, and listMessages showed the content mutated. That changes sanctioned record state outside the required closed-turn class.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"Story Scope: validate target closed turn\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"TC-5.1 positive closed-turn edit: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:141-189 verifies content, blocks, token estimate, cleared/queued result, and rebuild from edited content.\",\"TC-5.1 atomicity risk: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:191-223 verifies a cascade failure rolls back the content change and state/queue.\",\"TC-5.2: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:226-297 verifies exact dependent clear-set and byte-stable untouched forms/source versions.\",\"TC-5.3: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:300-368 verifies pending states, replacement work at new source versions, superseded ids reported, and rebuild from latest edit.\",\"TC-5.4: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:371-435 verifies a claimed pre-edit item reports stale_discarded and the post-edit artifact wins.\",\"TC-5.5 open/missing/deleted refusals: packages/lhc/test/mutations.test.ts:438-479 verifies stable codes and unchanged snapshots for those cases.\",\"TC-5.6: packages/lhc/test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts:80-140 verifies SDK/CLI parity for result JSON, cascade, and read-back; lines 142-170 verify CLI refusal parity.\",\"Story gate pnpm run green-verify passed.\",\"Epic gate pnpm run verify-all passed.\"],\"unverified\":[\"Closed-turn-only validation for messages with no turn membership is unmet: the current production path edits them successfully.\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"F-05-001: messages.edit mutates turnless/no-membership messages because null turnStatus is allowed and only open turns are refused.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No material fake adapter, mock path, shim, fallback, or placeholder branch was found in the audited production edit/cascade paths; the deterministic provider double is confined to tests.\",\"TC-5.6 lives in test/cli-process-mutations.test.ts rather than the story table's named cli-process-work.test.ts, but vitest.config.ts includes it under LHC_PROCESS_SUITE and verify-all ran it.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/05-message-edit-cascade/004-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-11T06:14:40.72